OL,3,GNEWSA'Bullying and anxiety' making
OL,4,Achildren skip school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBullying and anxiety are two of the
OL,7,Fmain reasons for non-attendance in
OL,8,Fsecondary schools in Bristol, according
OL,9,Fto a new report by councillors.
OL,11,FA task group has explored the problem,
OL,12,Fwith a focus on children aged 11 to 14,
OL,13,Fand found attendance overall has
OL,14,Fimproved slightly but ranks poorly
OL,15,Fnationally.
OL,17,FLast year, secondary school attendance
OL,18,Fin Bristol stood at 90%, less than the
OL,19,Fnational average of 92.4%, and only
OL,20,F88.2% in Hartcliffe and Withywood.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
