OL,3,GNEWSA'Bullying and anxiety' making
OL,4,Achildren skip school
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bristol City Council committee
OL,7,Freport also pointed to "growth in
OL,8,Fpersistent and severe absence" among
OL,9,Fpupils who were vulnerable or from
OL,10,Fdisadvantaged backgrounds.
